{
 "_doc": "The Thompson 1830 plat's own river at the forks, carried into EPSG:26916 through data/traces/gcp/thompson_1830_gcps.json and committed BESIDE the Wright 1834 line rather than over it. Generated by tools/thompson_forks.py --trace; `px` is the evidence and `utm` is derived from it by the committed fit, so tools/thompson_forks.py --check re-derives every utm vertex offline. NOTHING IN THE RECONSTRUCTION IS BUILT FROM THIS FILE. The terrain's banks remain data/terrain/epochs/e1834_harbor_cut/river.geojson, traced from Wright; this is the second reading the owner asked for so the two can be measured against each other (T-0685, docs/RESEARCH/thompson_vs_wright_forks.md).",
